#CHLOEAI:1
TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="src/**, lib/**, app/**"

LANGUAGE_RUNTIME:
- (fill in: language, runtime version, package manager)

BUILD:
- (fill in: build command, lint command, type check command)

STYLE_CONVENTIONS:
- (fill in: formatting tool, naming conventions, module layout)

FORBIDDEN_PATTERNS:
- No hardcoded secrets or API keys in source
- (fill in: language-specific forbidden patterns)

EXPLICITLY_NOT_TOUCHING:
- (fill in: generated files, vendored code, off-limits modules)
